{"id": "34457", "title": "结婚证书签不签？(爱情捉迷藏1)", "author": "橙星", "category": "文学名著", "count": 46, "available": 0, "cover": "", "status": "已完成", "source": "files/article/info/34/34457.htm", "intro": "虾米?!不过是租个房子,居然得是已婚身分？ 呿～～要是在平常,她一定掉头就走,谁理这种无聊事啊！ 可……现在的她却无法这样的随性、任性,只因── 呜呜……她已经把原来的住处退租,再加上这间新房子临近她暗恋的学长, 说什么她都得抱持必死的决心住进去！ 好,决定了,她去路上找个ㄤ,就假装是夫妻吧！ 而他,明明都跟他说好是假的、是演的,他为何老是含情脉脉的看著她？ 莫非……他真的爱上她了?! 就在她刚发现那暗恋的学长不喜欢她时,她难道就要遇见真爱了吗？ 满怀期待,她正想也对他表情意,却发现他竟“脚踏两条船”！ 哼！她立刻毁掉那份假的结婚证书走人,只是,她的心为何有点痛……", "base": "files/article/html/34/34457", "chapters": [{"title": "序言", "file": "2186954.html", "available": false}, {"title": "第1页", "file": "2186955.html", "available": false}, {"title": "第2页", "file": "2186956.html", "available": false}, {"title": "第3页", "file": "2186957.html", "available": false}, {"title": "第4页", "file": "2186958.html", "available": false}, {"title": "第5页", "file": "2186959.html", "available": false}, {"title": "第6页", "file": "2186960.html", "available": false}, {"title": "第7页", "file": "2186961.html", "available": false}, {"title": "第8页", "file": "2186962.html", "available": false}, {"title": "第9页", "file": "2186963.html", "available": false}, {"title": "第10页", "file": "2186964.html", "available": false}, {"title": "第11页", "file": "2186965.html", "available": false}, {"title": "第12页", "file": "2186966.html", "available": false}, {"title": "第13页", "file": "2186967.html", "available": false}, {"title": "第14页", "file": "2186968.html", "available": false}, {"title": "第15页", "file": "2186969.html", "available": false}, {"title": "第16页", "file": "2186970.html", "available": false}, {"title": "第17页", "file": "2186971.html", "available": false}, {"title": "第18页", "file": "2186972.html", "available": false}, {"title": "第19页", "file": "2186973.html", "available": false}, {"title": "第20页", "file": "2186974.html", "available": false}, {"title": "第21页", "file": "2186975.html", "available": false}, {"title": "第22页", "file": "2186976.html", "available": false}, {"title": "第23页", "file": 